WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.240
- [Man on Right] Oh hello, Barbie.

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.140
- [Man on Left] Bro, you need
to just chill out for a sec.

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.330
All right, you're a little too excited.

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:06.800
- [Man on Right] I'm just
excited for your date tonight.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.320
- Okay, you've been single for too long.

00:00:08.362 --> 00:00:11.260
(dreamy pop music)

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.530
- Even though I didn't play with Barbie,

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:14.780
I always had a crush on her.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.840
- Typically, it was just naked Barbie

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.670
being rescued by G.I. Joe.

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:20.130
- I was an awkward kid.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:22.752
I couldn't even talk to girls
in school, let alone dolls.

00:00:22.752 --> 00:00:23.880
- [Voiceover] We're gonna play dress up,

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.570
'cause you've got a date with Ken tonight.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:26.930
- Have we met Ken before?

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:28.260
- Maybe just give him one shot.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.310
- Okay.
- [Man on Right] We'll hang out

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:30.940
with him, and we'll see where it goes.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:31.870
(record scratching)

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:32.780
(upbeat pop music)

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.280
- Barbie, put on your dress!
- [Man in Plaid] Oh God.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:35.550
[Man on Right] He's gonna
be here in 10 minutes!

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:35.980
- [Man in Plaid] Okay.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:37.650
- I'm a big fan of the classics.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.700
We're gonna go with
the little black dress.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.640
- This is harder than dressing
my four-year-old daughter.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.290
- Do we only have one option on shoes?

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:45.560
These do not go.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:46.460
- Accessorize, people.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:47.820
Remember, accessories are important.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:49.978
- Okay, just zip me up.

00:00:49.978 --> 00:00:51.120
Don't get frisky.
- [Man on Right] Zip.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.478
- [Man on Right] All right.

00:00:52.478 --> 00:00:53.300
- [Man in Plaid] What are you do--

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.410
- I have never seen a
Barbie look that good.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.450
- That's actually kind of
an A plus first date outfit.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.670
- Barbie's going with a classic look.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:04.251
- She wants to look
versatile, yet fashionable.

00:01:04.251 --> 00:01:06.780
- [Both] Ohh!

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:09.575
(techno music)

00:01:09.575 --> 00:01:12.584
- Ken, oh my God, Ken!

00:01:12.584 --> 00:01:14.020
Ken, oh my God, Ken.

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:16.900
- [Man on Right] Thank you so
much for meeting me tonight.

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:17.840
- Am I supposed to be Ken?

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:18.910
- For right know, I'd just appreciate it

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:20.010
if you would be Ken for a little bit.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:21.380
- [Man on Left] Maybe we
could talk about that more

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.290
over dinner.

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:23.400
- You know who's driving.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.716
- [Man in Black] Hey, babe!

00:01:24.716 --> 00:01:25.570
(loud smooch)

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:27.450
- I feel absolutely silly right now.

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:28.350
- Ready?

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.280
Pedal to the metal.
(car whirring)

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:32.580
(pop electro music)

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:35.240
- Woah!

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:36.740
- Oh my!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.350
- Ken took Barbie on a date to her house?

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:40.780
That's a power move.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:42.000
He got her in the car and was like,

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.150
"Barbie, we're going out

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:44.160
"to your house."

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.750
- [Man on Right] You're gonna
notice the Italian marble.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:46.620
- [Man on Left] Very nice.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:47.790
- That didn't come cheap, but then again,

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:48.660
I'm not a cheap girl.

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:50.590
(toilet flushing)

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:52.030
- Barbie, what are you doing in there?

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:53.300
- Not pooping!

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.470
- Wee.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:00.420
- That is the coolest thing
I've ever done with a toy.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.730
- [Main in Black] Oh wait,
you know what's dope?

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:03.420
- Oh, second floor
- [Man in Black] Second story

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:04.660
- [Both] Jacuzzi!

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:06.020
- [Man in Black] Ahh!

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:10.150
(romantic acoustic music)

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:12.190
- [Man on Right] Ken, we're
here in my bedroom right now.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:12.830
- [Man on Left] Yes.

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:13.680
- Okay, but guess what?

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:15.680
Before anything would
happen here in this bedroom,

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.330
I need to know that you're
thinking about marriage.

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:20.077
(man on left laughing)

00:02:20.622 --> 00:02:22.990
- [Voiceover] I had fun
exploring this dream house.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:24.170
There's a lot to find.

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:26.610
- When my sister had her Barbies,
I wouldn't play with them,

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:28.590
but now I kinda brought
them into my world.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:31.050
- I do kind of wish I
did play with Barbies.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.360
- You see Barbie and you
expect her to be one way,

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:36.103
but when you get the toys and
you actually play with them

00:02:36.103 --> 00:02:38.036
it's whatever you want it to be.

00:02:38.036 --> 00:02:39.990
- [Man on Right] Oh my gosh, Ken.

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:41.420
- [Man on Left] I dance
better than Drake though

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:42.750
in that Hotline Bling song, don't I?

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.530
- Right now, I think I'm more concerned

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.350
with a song called Hotline Ken.

